* Loop filter for the r5 / 4-bit PLL at k = 4 (Icp 200 uA), PDK devices; candidate (docs/design/pll_loop.md).
* Rz: res_high_po_0p69, L 7.594 um = 4.13 kOhm at tt 27 C (409 ohm + 490 ohm/um, operating-point calibration).
* Ci: 18 cap_mim_m3_1 units of ~1 pF (side 22.1965 um, as passive_rc_pdk_candidate), 6 to ground and 12 to VDD (0.67,
* the supply-tone split of docs/design/pll_vco.md; to be re-set with this filter).  One instance per unit: the PDK
* subcircuit's mf only scales its mismatch term, not the capacitance.  No Cf: the VCO control node's own
* 0.2-0.7 pF is the shunt capacitor.  Dual-node precharge gates as passive_rc_precharge (needs that file and
* sky130_pfet_lvt.spice); the integrator gate is half the 40 pF version's size for the 18 pF node.
* Geometry / model view, not extracted layout.
.subckt pll_loop_filter_k4 cp_in ctrl z pre_ref pre_en vdd vss
