* Stacked PCell-compliant capacitor-fusion candidate for k = 4 (18 x 1 pF -> 6 stacked 27.22 x 27.22 um sites = 12 units):
* 2 sites (2 MIM1 + 2 MIM2 = 6.00 pF) to VSS + 4 sites (4 MIM1 + 4 MIM2 = 12.00 pF) to VDD, keeping 1:2 supply split
* and w/l = 27.22 um <= 30.0 um PDK PCell guard while halving 2D footprint via M3(vdd/vss)-M4(z)-M5(vdd/vss) stacking.
